      "message": "docs(guide): Wire Contour operation reference page\n\nOne reference page for the Wire EDM group's one shipped kind (Wire\nContour, #532): the wire EDM machine and conditions it needs, the\nGeometry/Heights/Passes settings with their seed defaults, the picks,\nand the refusals by their source text. Linked from the operations page\n(kinds table and the per-family references) and the machines page's\nEDM section. Sinker EDM has no operation yet; toolpath pictures are\nstill owed.\n\nRefs #1250\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
